{"access_note": "govinfo public-domain PDF; the Senate print is at https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/CPRT-93SPRT22786O/pdf/CPRT-93SPRT22786O.pdf (33 MB, OCR).", "added_on": "2026-11-06", "axiom_id": "WET-08", "census_families_hint": ["PD-WAR-EMERGENCY"], "class_scope": "all powers and authorities possessed as a result of any declaration of national emergency in effect on 1976-09-14, terminated two years from enactment (1978-09-14); Sec. 202(d) separately terminates future emergencies on their anniversary absent a continuation notice", "confidence": "high", "critic_note": "Sec. 101(a) terminates powers and authorities possessed as a result of existing emergencies, not the emergencies themselves; sec. 502 exempts listed statutes (critic).", "date": "1976-09-14", "found_by": "formulario-axiom-sweep wf_9443a6d3-4d1, family war-emergency-termination (sonnet researcher; opus completeness critic)", "instrument": "National Emergencies Act, Pub. L. 94-412 (Sept 14, 1976), Title I Sec. 101(a), 90 Stat. 1255", "instrument_kind": "statute", "notes": "Termination is of powers, saving pending actions, acts committed before the date and matured rights (Sec. 101(a)(1) to (3)). The pre-NEA emergencies still in effect per the Oct 1973 Senate committee print (CPRT-93SPRT22786O, foreword) were Roosevelt 1933, Proc. 2914 (Dec 16, 1950), Mar 23, 1970 and Aug 15, 1971. Gap: that committee print is secondary and is not Senate Report 93-549; the 1933 emergency's proclamation number was not confirmed.", "quote": "All powers and authorities possessed by the President, any other officer or employee of the Federal Government, or any executive agency ... as a result of the existence of any declaration of national emergency in effect on the date of enactment of this Act are terminated two years from the date of such enactment.", "relation": "repeals_authority", "relation_as_proposed": "terminates", "targets_named": [], "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/STATUTE-90/pdf/STATUTE-90-Pg1255.pdf", "url_kind": "pdf", "verified_by_fetch": true}
